{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e8393d79ceb92b0753bf89eec47cc2355b5ee46cbabf16f9b13f7dd1d6fa8dae", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n桃子が着替え中だけど、時間が掛かっているな……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。桃子正在换衣服，不过花的时间有点久啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "c5378da76f78bc32d71a8eac0d6adb8f9f8aa0bb71170e5dae826745cc364d79", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、おまたせ！\nちょっと遅くなっちゃった。時間大丈夫だよね？", "zh": "哥哥，让你久等了！\n稍微晚了一点。时间还来得及吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1002_p", "source_sha256": "551b96af8b0d8133e07c6ba8e0e94997b6f93c2e377f433662e5fe043bc063f7", "ja": "お疲れさま、桃子。\n大丈夫だけど、なにしてたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，桃子。\n没关系，不过你刚才在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "624b25f28df14f6f3b7b3a6c6ccf1aae1dcdccb4b5c7bcac2e3e0485d212425b", "ja": "ええと……衣装のチェックしたり。\n自撮りとかしてたの。", "zh": "那个……检查了一下服装什么的。\n还自拍来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "42f588a26fd707550a91200740c66796885de29dcd9ced8e41ce65e85055c1ee", "ja": "お仕事の一環として、だからね！\nほら、宣伝用の画像に使えるかもでしょ？", "zh": "这是工作的一部分，所以才做的！\n你看，说不定能用在宣传图片上呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1005_p", "source_sha256": "61c40e55a652ee1e75a3f947c4d51f6b8164acaec45ecf9cc54b5bc76f7d7876", "ja": "ああ、確かに。あると色々便利かもしれない。\nよく気付いてくれたな。", "zh": "啊，确实。有了这个，可能会方便很多。\n你能注意到这一点，真不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "4788a66bdbedc7522a20ed30a666e6d8c8c9389934109fc470154e60f8f084d6", "ja": "ふふん。雑誌のお仕事は何回もやってるからね。\nこれくらい、普通だよ。", "zh": "哼哼。杂志的工作我都做过好多次了嘛。\n这种程度，没什么大不了的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "2c079ba99d3da1e9c52d197b333c7cf78c4f934a90c9d68c1a3bbb5eb1e3afa0", "ja": "それにこのパジャマって、本当にいい衣装だし。\nちょっと撮っておきたかったっていうか……。", "zh": "而且这套睡衣真的很适合作为服装。就是……想稍微拍下来留个纪念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1008_p", "source_sha256": "54cc613d06532a399d852781fc03e1548a28ed36adfeb6d96bb2ac2bb2a8cb6d", "ja": "おっ、そんなに気に入ってくれたのか？\nだったら何よりだよ。", "zh": "哦，你这么喜欢啊？\n那就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "b1dfdbcba4ffda32b95482f300f10378823f596c9ecb7e70d0d04b45e41d7dcd", "ja": "べ、別に……あ。\n鏡見てて遅くなったとかじゃないからね！", "zh": "才、才不是……啊。才不是因为照镜子看得入迷才迟到的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "ba4474c629a5034423e66a4ee8a1afcb1304dc2808198906055a8e2769da5b65", "ja": "耳とかしっぽとか、コンセプトがしっかり\nしてるから、やりやすいかもって……それだけ。", "zh": "有耳朵和尾巴之类的，概念很明确，可能会比较好演……就这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bdfc42e29cb2a1a85fec724e79afcae6b12d4bae7af58e599c46cdc8dc7911e2", "ja": "うん。それだけだとしても。\n嬉しそうな桃子を見ていると、嬉しくなるもんだよ。", "zh": "嗯。就算只是那样，\n只要看到桃子开心的样子，我也会觉得很开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "ce9c42f1ce83b4768624b62db90dacc4e5ae68f0e746d5b3709989ebb0b62a19", "ja": "ふ、ふーん……。それじゃお兄ちゃん、\n撮影用の小物とかも、用意してくれる？", "zh": "哼、哼哼……。那哥哥，连拍摄用的小道具之类的，也会帮我准备吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "313db05f162adc7c80783452596fe1f33ce239efb1c9649c79099ffcfbc8a3bc", "ja": "アロマキャンドルとか、ポプリとか。\n桃子の好きな匂いがするのがいいな。", "zh": "香薰蜡烛、香囊之类的。\n最好是有桃子喜欢的香味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1014_p", "source_sha256": "356ab980fbfca1608391c76d0436212f725d7ed6d59c9f7c2516e787a72737ba", "ja": "確かに、雰囲気作りにもなりそうだしな。\nスタッフさんに相談してみるよ。", "zh": "确实，这样也能营造出氛围呢。\n我去跟工作人员商量一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "6395d8fbc8cb53f3355cac950e2f606a016690c0d8b60d4b0c9a70e094dec02d", "ja": "そうそう。匂いは目に見えないけど、\nちゃんと伝わるんだから。よろしくね、お兄ちゃん。", "zh": "对对。虽然气味看不见，\n但确实能传达出来。拜托你啦，哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9b12cf978bf1462f08e98af2685a084b523911700832aedeb1bf307eec21ec3d", "ja": "（確かに、目に見えなくても、写真から伝わる\nものがある。匂いとか……桃子の気持ちもそうだ）", "zh": "（确实，即使看不见，也有些东西能从照片中传达出来。气味之类的……桃子的心情也是如此）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0293_1017_p", "source_sha256": "200528b9cc969033a87fb49f6c9451d66a8f990569ec1ce8d9e23068c5407e17", "ja": "（きっといい写真になるって、予感がある。\nこっちこそよろしくな、桃子！）", "zh": "（我有预感，这会成为一张很棒的照片。桃子，我才要请你多多关照了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
